title="Naira Posts Its Biggest Daily Gain in Three Months After CBN Opens Dollar Cash Taps for BDCs",
excerpt="The naira rose N19 to N1,378 per dollar on 26 November, its biggest one-day gain in three months, after the CBN let banks sell up to $1 million in cash each week to bureaux de change.",
